:: R2-Wake-MarcusStats [release2 sidequest]
<<scene "img/ui/socialblade-chart.png" "Eight months to build what took me three years">>

I can't help it. I open Twitch and pull up his channel page. His schedule is pinned, five streams a week, consistent times, professional overlay, the kind of branding that screams someone competent is running this operation. His About section reads like a resume that got drunk at a party and started being charming about it.

His top clips. God, his top clips. The most viewed one has two point three million plays. It's him doing a backflip out of his gaming chair after a tournament win, shirtless, landing clean. Chat donated twelve thousand dollars in the next four minutes.

My top clip has eight thousand views. It's a decent headshot compilation set to music Jess picked. The top comment says "mid."

I close the app. Put my phone face down on the nightstand. Stare at the ceiling where there's a water stain shaped like Florida.

Jess comes out of the bathroom wrapped in a towel, hair dripping on the carpet.

//"Morning."//

//"Morning."//

She doesn't ask why I'm awake. I don't tell her I've been watching her future boss flex for ten minutes.

